#!/bin/sh
set -eu
# Friendly first-session notes in the default home skeleton.
mkdir -p /etc/skel
cat > /etc/skel/VYRONOS-START-HERE.txt <<'EOF'
WELCOME TO BHUPENDRA VYRONOS
Bhupendra's Workstation

This is an analytics-focused Ubuntu-based desktop prototype.

Available tools may include LibreOffice Calc, Python, Jupyter, MySQL and Git.
Before storing confidential data, review your system security and backup policies.
Live wallpaper is experimental and is not enabled by default.

Project status: prototype. Confirm installed applications and security settings on this machine.
EOF
